Oil analysis dashboard

This project is an interactive dashboard built with Streamlit to analyze the global oil market. 
It compares Brent and WTI crude oil prices, explores market volatility, and examines the impact 
of geopolitical events on oil price movements.

## Dataset

The dataset includes historical oil market data from 2010–2026, including:

- Brent crude oil price
- WTI crude oil price
- US Dollar Index (DXY)
- Market volatility index (VIX)
- Geopolitical Risk Index (GPR)
- Oil price returns
- Oil price volatility
- Geopolitical event indicators

## Dashboard Features

The Streamlit dashboard includes:

- Oil price comparison between Brent and WTI
- Brent–WTI price spread analysis
- Oil price volatility visualization
- Correlation between Brent and WTI prices
- Scatter plot analysis of oil prices
- Identification of geopolitical events affecting oil markets
- Interactive date filtering

## Technologies

- Python
- Pandas
- Plotly
- Streamlit